# Paths pqinv skips when scanning its own tree. The rule and pattern
# files name every algorithm the tool detects, and the test tables do
# the same — a regex scanner cannot tell a definition from a use, so
# this file is how a repo tells it. Same syntax works in any repo you
# scan: one Go path.Match glob per line; no slash = match the base name
# anywhere; trailing slash = directories only.
rules/rules.yaml
internal/probe/repo/patterns.yaml
*_test.go
